      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2015 SPLF. Published by Elsevier Masson SAS. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Inhaled therapies are widely prescribed. Several aspects of these treatments were considered during the 4th meeting of the aerosol therapy workgroup (GAT) of the French-speaking respiratory society (Société de pneumologie de langue française [SPLF]). In this report, will be detailed the medications delivered by the nasal route, particularly corticosteroids and vaccines as well as the ultra long-acting beta2-agonists, and inhaled therapies for asthma due to allergy to cat dander."
      },
